Surround yourself with Pure Aether, increasing all your arcane damage by [2.5%, 5.0%, 6.9%, 8.6%, 10% (TL1-5)] and ignoring [14%, 29%, 37%, 42%, 46% (TL1-5)] arcane resistance of your targets.

At level 5 casting Aether Avatar removes up to [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] magical or physical detrimental effects.
